Reviews: {filtered_car_reviews}
Addresses: {filtered_car_addresses}
Available car types: {filtered_car_types}
Select the company with the best rating and reviews (consider price as well). Return only the name of the best company.""",
            BestCarRentalModel
        )
        best_car_rental = best_car_rental_result.best_car_rental

        print("Recommended restaurant:", best_restaurant)
